WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,050 --> 00:00:01,920
Big brother

2
00:00:01,970 --> 00:00:04,650
Is this Huang Xingwen's house? What are you doing with my father?

3
00:00:04,930 --> 00:00:06,210
I'm here to fulfill someone else's wish

4
00:00:06,610 --> 00:00:11,940
Zhang Yuejun asked me to come over and bring him a few words.

5
00:00:12,460 --> 00:00:16,630
My dad just came back from the field and is asleep now. I want to teach him a lesson.

6
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:19,620
What's wrong, son?

7
00:00:19,940 --> 00:00:26,930
Zhang Yuejun, whom you have been reading about, has come to find you. You are his son. Son, please go out to play first and let’s talk.

8
00:00:27,570 --> 00:00:30,260
Doesn’t he know Zhang Yuejun’s identity? No, he doesn’t know.

9
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:32,140
I haven't told him in all these years

10
00:00:32,140 --> 00:00:34,690
After all, it's not a shameful thing to do. What happened to him?

11
00:00:34,690 --> 00:00:35,970
No news at all in so many years

12
00:00:36,210 --> 00:00:37,130
Did something happen to him?

13
00:00:37,250 --> 00:00:41,220
Otherwise, why did you find him? Do you want to tell him? Just tell him.

14
00:00:41,580 --> 00:00:44,220
By the way, tell him that I regret it. Don't say anything.

15
00:00:44,220 --> 00:00:49,930
How did he die? To put it simply, how did he die?

16
00:00:50,010 --> 00:00:51,410
He remains in the world now because of his obsession

17
00:00:51,490 --> 00:00:53,530
He asked me to come and see his son, that is to say

18
00:00:53,770 --> 00:00:54,690
He has become a ghost now

19
00:00:54,770 --> 00:00:58,660
You can still see him being able to get out and he told me

20
00:00:58,660 --> 00:01:02,180
Is he here now with a dark brown birthmark on your butt?

21
00:01:02,420 --> 00:01:03,340
Can I ever see him again?

22
00:01:03,540 --> 00:01:04,820
You are now divided into yin and yang

23
00:01:04,940 --> 00:01:06,220
He has to go to hell and enter reincarnation

24
00:01:07,050 --> 00:01:09,490
Then I'll never see him again in this life if he wants

25
00:01:09,650 --> 00:01:10,610
I can wait for you in the underworld

26
00:01:10,810 --> 00:01:11,850
You've been waiting for him for so many years

27
00:01:12,250 --> 00:01:18,510
It’s time for him to wait for you. Today we are a family

28
00:01:19,030 --> 00:01:20,310
Have a good reunion dinner

29
00:01:24,100 --> 00:01:25,420
Are you my mother's other son?

30
00:01:25,660 --> 00:01:27,180
Do you know who your mother is? No.

31
00:01:27,340 --> 00:01:29,340
Then do you know who Zhang Yuejun is? I know.

32
00:01:29,660 --> 00:01:37,100
As soon as my dad drank too much, he thought that this name should be my mom. Okay, don’t ask so many questions. I’m not your brother. I should go and take good care of your dad.
